      (_root_.GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.Ar.Plug.IndependentCountBound.vol_mul_flagDeg_le_growthOn hRR hG E H Dw l Xo c r U h e hL x hx Y T o κ II hC hF hP hT1 Z u hu)
